{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Luna Tactics</strong> is a turn-based tactical game that blends the strategic depth of classic RPGs with the unpredictability and nuance of tabletop systems. Inspired by D&amp;D 5e rules, each battle is a challenge where positioning, abilities, and planning are just as important as brute strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn-Based Tactical System</strong>: Control a team of heroes on maps with elevation, cover, and traps \u2014 where every move can determine victory or defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat Inspired by D&amp;D 5e</strong>: HP, MP, attacks, spells, potions, modifiers \u2014 all faithfully adapted from traditional RPG mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Progression</strong>: Level up, allocate attributes, learn new abilities, and shape your ideal tactical strategy.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760410?t=1748602013","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760410/3a8d898f6bd654f0935e2b80c384d980dc98cf63/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748602013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760410/38df0e16e72ad408b20de56800bfd91455ef588f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748602013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760410/38df0e16e72ad408b20de56800bfd91455ef588f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748602013","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Luna Tactics</strong> is a turn-based tactical game that blends the strategic depth of classic RPGs with the unpredictability and nuance of tabletop systems. Inspired by D&amp;D 5e rules, each battle is a challenge where positioning, abilities, and planning are just as important as brute strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn-Based Tactical System</strong>: Control a team of heroes on maps with elevation, cover, and traps \u2014 where every move can determine victory or defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat Inspired by D&amp;D 5e</strong>: HP, MP, attacks, spells, potions, modifiers \u2014 all faithfully adapted from traditional RPG mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Progression</strong>: Level up, allocate attributes, learn new abilities, and shape your ideal tactical strategy.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Danilo"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Danilo Prado Oliveira Camargo ","genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760410/8a42c0ae03e2fecbf2ad8a21908f9bbe92b3ac0b/header.jpg?t=1748602013","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146001,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146001/movie480.mp4?t=1748602011","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146001/movie_max.mp4?t=1748602011"},"name":"Luna Tactics Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146001/f925bd95b3b59492dfcaa53619b46487d84eca1e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748602011","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146001/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748602011","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146001/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748602011"}}],"name":"Luna Tactics","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><